    nt_section_dns_text: 'Resolve any domain to its A, AAAA, MX, TXT, NS, CNAME, and SOA records in one query. All lookups go over DNS-over-HTTPS so your queries are private, and the answers are grouped by record type for easy scanning.',
    nt_section_status_h2: 'Service status checker',
    nt_section_status_text: 'Paste any URL to see if it is reachable from your network, plus live status for 50+ popular services straight from their official status pages. Includes active incidents with impact and resolution status.',
