    wdc_faq_3_a: 'From each service\'s public status page, mostly hosted on Atlassian Statuspage. We poll the public summary endpoint and the incident feed, so the data you see is the same data the service publishes to its own customers. We do not guess or infer outages from user reports — only declared ones.',
    wdc_faq_4_q: 'What if the site I want to check isn\'t in your tracker?',
